            <html:p><html:em>Uses:</html:em> <fr:link href="/ffi/ffi-0023/" title="(S): the n = 9 reduction" uri="https://www.brendan.phd/ffi/ffi-0023/" display-uri="ffi-0023" type="local">(S): the n = 9 reduction</fr:link>.</html:p>
